@startuml pausa
!include theme.puml
hide footbox

autonumber
participant "Hilo main" as M
participant "command_queue" as C
participant "Hilo sensor" as S
participant "result_queue" as R
participant "pause_ack" as A
participant "RGB / GPIO" as RGB

M -> M: [[https://github.com/PabloHernaez/Embedded_Assessments/blob/master/Assessment_1/src/sensor_thread.c#L149{sensor_pause} sensor_pause]](K_MSEC(1000))
M -> A: k_sem_reset()
M -> C: Encolar PAUSE con K_NO_WAIT
C --> M: Orden aceptada
M -> M: atomic_clear(run_requested)
M -> A: k_sem_take(): esperar confirmación
note over M: main queda bloqueado.\nEl sensor y las interrupciones pueden avanzar.
alt El sensor esperaba el próximo plazo
    C --> S: La recepción entrega PAUSE
else Detecta bandera cero antes o después del promedio
    S -> S: Evitar nueva lectura o descartar resultado
    S -> S: Continuar a la siguiente vuelta del bucle
    C --> S: La recepción entrega PAUSE pendiente
end
S -> S: active = false
S -> S: [[https://github.com/PabloHernaez/Embedded_Assessments/blob/master/Assessment_1/src/sensor_thread.c#L37{acknowledge_pause()} acknowledge_pause()]]
S -> R: Vaciar resultados pendientes
S -> A: k_sem_give()
A --> M: k_sem_take() retorna 0
M -> M: [[https://github.com/PabloHernaez/Embedded_Assessments/blob/master/Assessment_1/src/sensor_thread.c#L149{sensor_pause()} sensor_pause()]] retorna 0
M -> RGB: [[https://github.com/PabloHernaez/Embedded_Assessments/blob/master/Assessment_1/src/rgb_led.c#L48{rgb_set} rgb_set]](RGB_BLUE o RGB_OFF)
note over S: Vuelve a esperar órdenes con K_FOREVER
@enduml
